---
title: "Compare Zanzibar Tours Side by Side | Spice & Sail"
description: "Compare Zanzibar tours by price, duration, category, and what's included. Find the best tour for your budget and interests."
permalink: /compare-tours/index.html
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="" id="main-content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Compare Zanzibar Tours</h1>
    <p class="page-meta">Side-by-side comparison of all Spice & Sail tours. Filter by category, price, and duration to find your perfect excursion.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="table-responsive" style="overflow-x:auto;">
        <table class="comparison-table" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;">
          <thead>
            <tr style="background:#003853;color:#fff;">
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;text-align:left;">Tour</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;text-align:left;">Category</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;text-align:left;">Duration</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;text-align:right;">Price (USD)</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;text-align:left;">Deposit</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;text-align:left;">Weather Policy</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;text-align:center;">Details</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for svc in conciergeCat.services %}
              {% if svc.type == "tour" %}
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8ed;{% if loop.index % 2 == 0 %}background:#f8fafc;{% endif %}">
                <td style="padding:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">{{ svc.name }}</td>
                <td style="padding:0.75rem;">{{ svc.category }}</td>
                <td style="padding:0.75rem;">{{ svc.duration }}</td>
                <td style="padding:0.75rem;text-align:right;font-weight:700;">${{ svc.pricing.min }}–${{ svc.pricing.max }}</td>
                <td style="padding:0.75rem;">{% if svc.pricing.depositPercent > 0 %}{{ svc.pricing.depositPercent }}%{% else %}0%{% endif %}</td>
                <td style="padding:0.75rem;font-size:0.8rem;">{{ svc.importantNotes[0] if svc.importantNotes else 'Standard' }}</td>
                <td style="padding:0.75rem;text-align:center;">
                  <a href="/tours/{{ svc.slug }}/" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">View</a>
                </td>
              </tr>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Quick Guide</span>
        <h2>Which Tour Is Right for You?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
          <h3>💰 Budget-Friendly (Under $60)</h3>
          <p>Stone Town walking tour, village community tour, sunset dhow cruise, Jozani Forest. Great for travelers watching costs without missing the highlights.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal delay-2" style="padding:1.5rem;">
          <h3>🌊 Marine & Snorkeling</h3>
          <p>Safari Blue, Mnemba snorkeling, Nakupenda sandbank, Prison Island combo. All include snorkel gear and marine park fees.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal delay-3" style="padding:1.5rem;">
          <h3>Airport & Transfers</h3>
          <p>Private airport transfers from $25 (Stone Town) to $55 (East Coast). 0% deposit — pay driver on arrival.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal delay-4" style="padding:1.5rem;">
          <h3>Multi-Day Packages</h3>
          <p>Zanzibar Essentials 3-Day Pass saves $65–305 vs booking separately. Includes all transfers, fees, and WhatsApp concierge.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-content reveal">
      <h2>Not Sure Which Tour?</h2>
      <p>Message us on WhatsApp with your dates, budget, and interests. We'll recommend the perfect combination within 24 hours.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=I'd like help choosing tours" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Get Personalized Advice</a>
        <a href="/tours/" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Browse All Tours</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}